# Architecture Rules

- Use `schemas/architecture.schema.yaml` for all architecture docs.
- Every design must include: context, decision, alternatives considered, trade-offs.
- ADRs go to `docs/decisions/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`.
- System diagrams go to `docs/architecture/`.
- Prefer Mermaid for diagrams.
